What is Nylon Compression Sportswear?
Nylon compression garments are engineered to apply graduated pressure to specific muscle groups, thereby enhancing circulation, reducing vibration, and supporting faster recovery. The use of nylon fibers enables a smooth hand‑feel, high elasticity and excellent abrasion resistance, allowing designers to create seamless, form‑fitting pieces that maintain their shape through repeated washes and intense activity.
